{"schema_version": "2.0", "record_type": "finance_news_article", "article_id": "bbf45eefc3879224bb2ffa2c", "title": "欧洲多趟航班过去两天收到炸弹威胁 被迫改道", "url": "https://finance.sina.com.cn/stock/usstock/c/2026-11-04/doc-inixnuik9722427.shtml", "source": "新浪财经", "source_id": "sina_finance", "source_tier": "T1", "published_at": "2026-11-04T00:16:06+08:00", "crawled_at": "2026-11-04T00:23:11.398335+08:00", "status": "valid", "quality_score": 0.976, "quality_flags": [], "hotness": {"score": 82.098, "list_rank": 2, "list_size": 194, "rank_percentile": 0.9948, "source_priority": 6, "source_tier": "T1", "has_engagement_metrics": true, "engagement_score": 0.0}, "engagement": {"has_any_metric": true, "available_metrics": ["comment_count"], "missing_metrics": ["read_count", "view_count", "like_count", "favorite_count", "share_count", "repost_count"], "available_metric_count": 1, "counts": {"read_count": null, "view_count": null, "comment_count": 0, "like_count": null, "favorite_count": null, "share_count": null, "repost_count": null}, "score": 0.0, "metric_source": "sina_finance_detail_html+sina_comment_api", "collected_at": "2026-11-04T00:23:11.398335+08:00", "quality_flags": [], "raw": {"sina_comment_api": {"sina_comment_count": {"total": 0, "show": 0, "thread_show": 0, "qreply_show": 0, "qreply": 0}, "api_url": "https://comment5.news.sina.com.cn/cmnt/count?format=json&newslist=cj%3Acomos-nixnuik9722427", "comment_channel": "cj", "comment_id": "comos-nixnuik9722427"}}}, "source_info": {"id": "sina_finance", "name": "新浪财经", "tier": "T1", "role": "market_news", "priority": 6, "section": "滚动新闻"}, "time_info": {"published_at": "2026-11-04T00:16:06+08:00", "published_date": "2026-11-04", "crawled_at": "2026-11-04T00:23:11.398335+08:00", "crawl_date": "2026-11-04", "timezone": "Asia/Shanghai", "age_minutes_at_crawl": 7.09, "published_after_crawl": false}, "content_info": {"title_length": 21, "content_length": 389, "has_content": true, "excerpt": "过去两天，欧洲多趟航班收到炸弹威胁，迫使载有数百名乘客的飞机改道，并在抵达后接受搜查。 相关航空公司表示，自周一以来，威兹航空两趟航班、波兰航空一趟航班以及北欧航空一趟航班均收到威胁。据报道，至少两趟瑞安航空航班也受到影响。 目前尚不清楚这些威胁的来源和动机，但已知事件多数针对飞往东欧目的地的航班。波兰一直是各种网络攻击和混合攻击的目标，波兰官员称这些袭击与俄罗斯有关。 威兹航空一名发言人表示，一趟从意大利贝加莫飞往保加利亚索非亚的航班周二收到威胁，抵达后接受了搜查。周一，一", "author": "环球市场播报", "keywords": []}, "extraction": {"entrypoint_url": "https://finance.sina.com.cn/roll/", "raw_html_path": null, "list_rank": 2, "list_size": 194, "captured_at": "2026-11-04T00:23:11.398335+08:00", "method": "滚动新闻"}, "quality": {"status": "valid", "score": 0.976, "grade": "A", "flags": [], "review_required": false, "downstream_usable": true}, "content": "过去两天，欧洲多趟航班收到炸弹威胁，迫使载有数百名乘客的飞机改道，并在抵达后接受搜查。 相关航空公司表示，自周一以来，威兹航空两趟航班、波兰航空一趟航班以及北欧航空一趟航班均收到威胁。据报道，至少两趟瑞安航空航班也受到影响。 目前尚不清楚这些威胁的来源和动机，但已知事件多数针对飞往东欧目的地的航班。波兰一直是各种网络攻击和混合攻击的目标，波兰官员称这些袭击与俄罗斯有关。 威兹航空一名发言人表示，一趟从意大利贝加莫飞往保加利亚索非亚的航班周二收到威胁，抵达后接受了搜查。周一，一趟从伦敦卢顿机场飞往索非亚的航班也因同样原因改道飞往布达佩斯。 北欧航空一名发言人表示，一趟往返哥本哈根和华沙的航班也收到威胁，目前警方正在处理此事。 瑞安航空没有回应置评请求。BBC播出的视频显示，一架从英国曼彻斯特起飞的瑞安航 空客 机降落在西班牙穆尔西亚后，当局人员带着警犬对飞机进行了检查。", "author": "环球市场播报", "section": "滚动新闻", "keywords": [], "hot_features": {"source_prominence": {"list_rank": 2, "list_size": 194, "source_priority": 6, "source_tier": "T1", "entrypoint": "https://finance.sina.com.cn/roll/", "captured_at": "2026-11-04T00:23:11.398335+08:00"}, "engagement_metrics": {"read_count": null, "view_count": null, "comment_count": 0, "like_count": null, "favorite_count": null, "share_count": null, "repost_count": null, "collected_at": "2026-11-04T00:23:11.398335+08:00", "source": "sina_finance_detail_html+sina_comment_api", "available_fields": ["comment_count"], "missing_fields": ["read_count", "view_count", "like_count", "favorite_count", "share_count", "repost_count"], "quality_flags": [], "raw": {"sina_comment_api": {"sina_comment_count": {"total": 0, "show": 0, "thread_show": 0, "qreply_show": 0, "qreply": 0}, "api_url": "https://comment5.news.sina.com.cn/cmnt/count?format=json&newslist=cj%3Acomos-nixnuik9722427", "comment_channel": "cj", "comment_id": "comos-nixnuik9722427"}}}}, "diagnostics": {