欧元，此前指引为超100亿欧元，此前目标约100亿欧元，2025年该行净利润为93.2亿欧元。本次上调得益于佣金与保险业务收入带动营收走高、成本平稳、拨备大幅下降，即便2026年意政府预算案带来近10亿欧元税务负担仍完成上修。该行三季度净利润26.45亿欧元，超分析师预期的25.4亿欧元，当期营收69.2亿欧元，同比增4.2%。该行拟发起对西雅那银行的收购，若收购成功将提前三年达成2026-2029商业计划全部目", "author": "环球市场播报", "keywords": []}, "extraction": {"entrypoint_url": "https://finance.sina.com.cn/roll/", "raw_html_path": null, "list_rank": 5, "list_size": 194, "captured_at": "2026-11-04T00:23:11.398335+08:00", "method": "滚动新闻"}, "quality": {"status": "valid", "score": 0.976, "grade": "A", "flags": [], "review_required": false, "downstream_usable": true}, "content": "意大利联合圣保罗银行第二次上调2026年净利润预期，远超100亿欧元，此前指引为超100亿欧元，此前目标约100亿欧元，2025年该行净利润为93.2亿欧元。本次上调得益于佣金与保险业务收入带动营收走高、成本平稳、拨备大幅下降，即便2026年意政府预算案带来近10亿欧元税务负担仍完成上修。该行三季度净利润26.45亿欧元，超分析师预期的25.4亿欧元，当期营收69.2亿欧元，同比增4.2%。该行拟发起对西雅那银行的收购，若收购成功将提前三年达成2026-2029商业计划全部目标，合并后集团2029年净利润预计超160亿欧元。(AI生成)", "author": "环球市场播报", "section": "滚动新闻", "keywords": [], "hot_features": {"source_prominence": {"list_rank": 5, "list_size": 194, "source_priority": 6, "source_tier": "T1", "entrypoint": "https://finance.sina.com.cn/roll/", "captured_at": "2026-11-04T00:23:11.398335+08:00"}, "engagement_metrics": {"read_count": null, "view_count": null, "comment_count": 0, "like_count": null, "favorite_count": null, "share_count": null, "repost_count": null, "collected_at": "2026-11-04T00:23:11.398335+08:00", "source": "sina_finance_detail_html+sina_comment_api", "available_fields": ["comment_count"], "missing_fields": ["read_count", "view_count", "like_count", "favorite_count", "share_count", "repost_count"], "quality_flags": [], "raw": {"sina_comment_api": {"sina_comment_count": {"total": 0, "show": 0, "thread_show": 0, "qreply_show": 0, "qreply": 0}, "api_url": "https://comment5.news.sina.com.cn/cmnt/count?format=json&newslist=cj%3Acomos-nixnuik9718358", "comment_channel": "cj", "comment_id": "comos-nixnuik9718358"}}}}, "diagnostics": {"content_hash": "d0c718eca03798117cb61b0ad1c929d3e55740292fbdeb5e119916c3b0918618", "title_hash": "4ca3b8