{"schema_version": "2.0", "record_type": "finance_news_article", "article_id": "d94f5d7965bac46bf1fbda83", "title": "AI在多线中期选举博弈中直面选民", "url": "https://finance.sina.com.cn/stock/usstock/c/2026-11-04/doc-inixnuir8471748.shtml", "source": "新浪财经", "source_id": "sina_finance", "source_tier": "T1", "published_at": "2026-11-04T00:07:31+08:00", "crawled_at": "2026-11-04T00:23:11.398335+08:00", "status": "valid", "quality_score": 0.976, "quality_flags": [], "hotness": {"score": 81.377, "list_rank": 6, "list_size": 194, "rank_percentile": 0.9742, "source_priority": 6, "source_tier": "T1", "has_engagement_metrics": true, "engagement_score": 0.0}, "engagement": {"has_any_metric": true, "available_metrics": ["comment_count"], "missing_metrics": ["read_count", "view_count", "like_count", "favorite_count", "share_count", "repost_count"], "available_metric_count": 1, "counts": {"read_count": null, "view_count": null, "comment_count": 0, "like_count": null, "favorite_count": null, "share_count": null, "repost_count": null}, "score": 0.0, "metric_source": "sina_finance_detail_html+sina_comment_api", "collected_at": "2026-11-04T00:23:11.398335+08:00", "quality_flags": [], "raw": {"sina_comment_api": {"sina_comment_count": {"total": 0, "show": 0, "thread_show": 0, "qreply_show": 0, "qreply": 0}, "api_url": "https://comment5.news.sina.com.cn/cmnt/count?format=json&newslist=cj%3Acomos-nixnuir8471748", "comment_channel": "cj", "comment_id": "comos-nixnuir8471748"}}}, "source_info": {"id": "sina_finance", "name": "新浪财经", "tier": "T1", "role": "market_news", "priority": 6, "section": "滚动新闻"}, "time_info": {"published_at": "2026-11-04T00:07:31+08:00", "published_date": "2026-11-04", "crawled_at": "2026-11-04T00:23:11.398335+08:00", "crawl_date": "2026-11-04", "timezone": "Asia/Shanghai", "age_minutes_at_crawl": 15.67, "published_after_crawl": false}, "content_info": {"title_length": 16, "content_length": 299, "has_content": true, "excerpt": "中期选举前夕，人工智能已全面渗透美国各类政治竞选。不同机构对民众用AI了解候选人和公投议案的普及度估算差异较大，全国公民大会数据显示上月有部分成年人曾向聊天机器人查询国会或州长候选人信息，皮尤给出的比例则低得多。竞选团队借AI优化宣传物料、升级选民广告精准定向技术，卫斯理安媒体项目统计，政治广告投放方在AI生成或优化的广告上花费约8000万美元，大多未设置相关提示免责声明。部分政客将AI改称“超级智能”，也有人呼吁加强监管，多州就数据中心举办公投。本次选举含40余项地方公投议", "author": "环球市场播报", "keywords": []}, "extraction": {"entrypoint_url": "https://finance.sina.com.cn/roll/", "raw_html_path": null, "list_rank": 6, "list_size": 194, "captured_at": "2026-11-04T00:23:11.398335+08:00", "method": "滚动新闻"}, "quality": {"status": "valid", "score": 0.976, "grade": "A", "flags": [], "review_required": false, "downstream_usable": true}, "content": "中期选举前夕，人工智能已全面渗透美国各类政治竞选。不同机构对民众用AI了解候选人和公投议案的普及度估算差异较大，全国公民大会数据显示上月有部分成年人曾向聊天机器人查询国会或州长候选人信息，皮尤给出的比例则低得多。竞选团队借AI优化宣传物料、升级选民广告精准定向技术，卫斯理安媒体项目统计，政治广告投放方在AI生成或优化的广告上花费约8000万美元，大多未设置相关提示免责声明。部分政客将AI改称“超级智能”，也有人呼吁加强监管，多州就数据中心举办公投。本次选举含40余项地方公投议案、三十多场州长选举等，不会就AI议题给出太多明确最终结论，但计票结果可反映公众真正共鸣的宣传话术与工具。(AI生成)", "author": "环球市场播报", "section": "滚动新闻", "keywords": [], "hot_features": {"source_prominence": {"list_rank": 6, "list_size": 194, "source_priority": 6, "source_tier": "T1", "entrypoint": "https://finance.sina.com.cn/roll/", "captured_at": "2026-11-04T00:23:11.398335+08:00"}, "engagement_metrics": {"read_count": null, "view_count": null, "comment_count": 0, "like_count": null, "favorite_count": null, "share_count": null, "repost_count": null, "collected_at": "2026-11-04T00:23:11.398335+08:00", "source": "sina_finance_detail_html+sina_comment_api", "available_fields": ["comment_count"], "missing_fields": ["read_count", "view_count", "like_count", "favorite_count", "share_count", "repost_count"], "quality_flags": [], "raw": {"sina_comment_api": {"sina_comment_count": {"total": 0, "show": 0, "thread_show": 0, "qreply_show": 0, "qreply": 0}, "api_url": "https://comment5.news.sina.com.cn/cmnt/count?format=json&newslist=cj%3Acomos-nixnuir8471748", "comment_channel": "cj", "comment_id": "comos-nixnuir8471748"}}}}, "diagnostics": {"content_hash": "1dedb3f4ca4cdfd972c7a007cdb0080b0fcfa1994a51057a186aed5032929912", "title_has